  "text": {
    "source": "data/config/research_player/english/task_catalogs/text.json",
    "items": [
      {
        "item_id": "t_01",
        "item_number": "T1",
        "text": "The Boy who Cried Wolf"
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_02",
        "item_number": "T2",
        "text": "There was once a poor shepherd boy, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_03",
        "item_number": "T3",
        "text": "a child more than a man, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_04",
        "item_number": "T4",
        "text": "who loved sleeping in his bed all day. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_05",
        "item_number": "T5",
        "text": "His job was to watch his father’s flocks "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_06",
        "item_number": "T6",
        "text": "in the fields next to a vast dark forest "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_07",
        "item_number": "T7",
        "text": "with old trees near the foot of a very large mountain."
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_08",
        "item_number": "T8",
        "text": "He did not love his job at all. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_09",
        "item_number": "T9",
        "text": "So, one hot afternoon "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_10",
        "item_number": "T10",
        "text": "— a pup was chasing birds and bats in the cave nearby — "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_11",
        "item_number": "T11",
        "text": "he thought to himself "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_12",
        "item_number": "T12",
        "text": "‘Let someone else do it!’ "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_13",
        "item_number": "T13",
        "text": "He devised a good plan,"
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_14",
        "item_number": "T14",
        "text": "both to get some company for himself"
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_15",
        "item_number": "T15",
        "text": " and also have a little fun. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_16",
        "item_number": "T16",
        "text": "Raising his fist in the air, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_17",
        "item_number": "T17",
        "text": "he ran down to the village "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_18",
        "item_number": "T18",
        "text": "and then he shouted ‘Wolf, Wolf!’ "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_19",
        "item_number": "T19",
        "text": "As soon as they heard him,"
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_20",
        "item_number": "T20",
        "text": "the villagers all rushed from their homes, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_21",
        "item_number": "T21",
        "text": "full of concern for his safety. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_22",
        "item_number": "T22",
        "text": "Two of his younger cousins, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_23",
        "item_number": "T23",
        "text": "Kenny and Annie,"
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_24",
        "item_number": "T24",
        "text": "even invited him to their home "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_25",
        "item_number": "T25",
        "text": "to stay with them for a short while "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_26",
        "item_number": "T26",
        "text": "to make sure he was safe. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_27",
        "item_number": "T27",
        "text": "This gave the boy so much pleasure "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_28",
        "item_number": "T28",
        "text": "that he had to laugh, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_29",
        "item_number": "T29",
        "text": "and a few days later "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_30",
        "item_number": "T30",
        "text": "he tried exactly the same trick again, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_31",
        "item_number": "T31",
        "text": "and once more he was successful. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_32",
        "item_number": "T32",
        "text": "However, not long after, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_33",
        "item_number": "T33",
        "text": "a violent wolf, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_34",
        "item_number": "T34",
        "text": "full of hunger and rage, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_35",
        "item_number": "T35",
        "text": "had just escaped from the zoo. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_36",
        "item_number": "T36",
        "text": "It was looking for a change "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_37",
        "item_number": "T37",
        "text": "from its usual diet of chicken and duck."
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_38",
        "item_number": "T38",
        "text": "So, overcoming its fear of being shot, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_39",
        "item_number": "T39",
        "text": "the big bad wolf actually did come out from the forest"
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_40",
        "item_number": "T40",
        "text": " and began to threaten the sheep. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_41",
        "item_number": "T41",
        "text": "The boy raced down to the village "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_42",
        "item_number": "T42",
        "text": "and of course cried out even louder than before: "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_43",
        "item_number": "T43",
        "text": "‘Wolf, wolf, we need to save the sheep’. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_44",
        "item_number": "T44",
        "text": "But even though he screamed at the top of his voice, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_45",
        "item_number": "T45",
        "text": "all the men and women, unfortunately, were convinced "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_46",
        "item_number": "T46",
        "text": "that he was trying to fool them a third time. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_47",
        "item_number": "T47",
        "text": "They wouldn’t listen to him any longer "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_48",
        "item_number": "T48",
        "text": "and not even raise one finger. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_49",
        "item_number": "T49",
        "text": "They told him, "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_50",
        "item_number": "T50",
        "text": "‘Where is it? "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_51",
        "item_number": "T51",
        "text": "Show us. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_52",
        "item_number": "T52",
        "text": "We can’t see it! "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_53",
        "item_number": "T53",
        "text": "Go away and don’t bother us any further’ "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_54",
        "item_number": "T54",
        "text": "and went to the pub "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_55",
        "item_number": "T55",
        "text": "to listen to the famous singer that had a gig there. "
      },
      {
        "item_id": "t_56",
        "item_number": "T56",
        "text": "And so the wolf had a feast."
      }
    ]
  }
}
